0..72 Comment "// A module\'s family applied through its name, as `Shapes.Opt(Integer)`."
73..75 Comment "//"
76..153 Comment "// A client reaches a module\'s family only through the module\'s name. A model"
154..225 Comment "// of a theory with an indexed sort supplies the sort as such a family."
226..228 Comment "//"
229..307 Comment "// A type family member expands over its arguments, as the family does applied"
308..383 Comment "// inside the module. A data family member stands at its arguments, and its"
384..450 Comment "// constructor builds and opens a value through the module\'s name."
451..453 Comment "//"
454..508 Comment "// - see: #3051 — the qualified head\'s argument list"
509..584 Comment "// - see: `pathological/modules/family-applied.gandr` — an application of"
585..612 Comment "//   another count, refused"
